\subsection{Discussion}

Our system is not expected to beat the human writers by a huge margin (see \cite{Nenkova-acl2010}) in the contest, since the system can only handle a limited number of words. We anticipate that the system can achieve $ROUGE-1$ F1 score of $35$--$40$ and BLEU score of $24$--$28$, depending on the content of the given paragraph.

 There is no need to read all the content.

